  "data": {
    "summary": "A unit with at least one model carrying an **[ASSAULT]** weapon may use the [Assault Shooting](vsdata:core-rule/assault-shooting) type (10.05). The ability does nothing more by itself: Assault Shooting is open only to a unit that is unengaged and [Advanced](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) this turn, and it limits that unit to its **[ASSAULT]** weapons.",
